OL,3,AStar Trek stars lead tributes to
OL,4,A'magnificent actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FStewart's award-winning career spanned
OL,8,Fseven decades and, along with his time
OL,9,Fon screens, it included starring roles
OL,10,Fon West End and Broadway
OL,12,FThe Royal Shakespeare Company, where
OL,13,Fthe actor spent his early days on
OL,14,Fstage, describes him as a "colossus"
OL,15,Fand fans in Los Angeles are gathering
OL,16,Faround his star on the Hollywood Walk
OL,17,Fof Fame
OL,19,FStewart died at his home in Los Angeles
OL,20,Fon Wednesday, according to a statement
OL,21,Fshared on his social media
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
