OL,3,AStar Trek stars lead tributes to
OL,4,A'magnificent actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis appeal crossed generations, and
OL,8,Fyounger fans would have discovered his
OL,9,Fwork on streaming platforms, writes our
OL,10,Fculture correspondent Noor Nanji
